      "plainSummary": "To apply to UT Austin engineering, geosciences, the environmental science majors, or computer science and its joint majors, you show calculus readiness: an SAT Math 620+, ACT Math 26+ or CLT Math 26+ score, AP Calculus 3+, IB HL Math 4+, or Calculus I with a B or higher on your transcript, received by December 10.",
      "strength": "required",
      "strengthCite": "tx-ut-calc-majors",
      "confidence": "verified",
      "cohortKey": "class_year",
